#. <CLT 4>そっと脱衣所のドアを開け、
#. 中の様子をうかがう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We opened the door to the dressing room, silent as\n"
"death, and peeked inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すでに、女子のみんなは着替えを済ませ、
#. 浴場へと移動したようだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looked like the girls had already finished\n"
"changing and gone into the bathhouse.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ウソとは言えども…
#. 本当にお風呂には入ったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This had all started as a lie, but apparently\n"
"they'd decided to go in for real.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それを確認したボクは、
#. 脱衣所にそっと足を踏み入れる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Making sure it was empty, we quietly made our way into\n"
"the dressing room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>禁断の…地へ……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The...forbidden land...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あいつら、マジで風呂に入ったんだな。
#. ウソつくなら徹底的にって事か…
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"So they really are taking a bath. Is this what Celeste\n"
"meant about lying convincingly?"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠康比呂殿…無駄な私語は慎んでいただこう。
#. ここは、もはや敵地ですぞ。
msgctxt "0007 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Mr. Hagakure, please refrain from pointless\n"
"whispering. We're deep in enemy territory here..."
msgstr ""

#. この先が大浴場…
#. そこに、めくるめく大欲情が…！
msgctxt "0008 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Just up ahead is the bathhouse. And there awaits...a\n"
"great dazzling passion!"
msgstr ""

#. グフフ…
#. 先陣は苗木誠殿に任せましたぞ…
msgctxt "0009 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Gwehehe... Mr. Naegi, you're on point...!"
msgstr ""

#. 見つからんように慎重にな…
#. オーガにばれたら…霊界で魂の修行だべ…
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Be careful, don't get us caught! If Ogre finds us,\n"
"we'll be meeting up with Hades in no time...!"
msgstr ""

#. どうされました、苗木誠殿！
#. そこにロマンはありませんぞ！
msgctxt "0011 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"What are you doing, Mr. Naegi!? There are no fantasies\n"
"in there!"
msgstr ""

#. 落ち着くのです、素数を数えるのですッ！
msgctxt "0012 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"If you need to calm down, try counting prime\n"
"numbers..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大浴場のドアに手をかけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I placed my hand on the door leading into the\n"
"bathhouse.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そっと開けていく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I opened it gently, inch by inch...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>音を立てないように…
#. 職人のような手付きで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I maneuvered my hand like a master craftsman, to avoid\n"
"making even the slightest sound...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>少しずつ…少しずつ……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A little further...a little further...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もうもうと立ち昇る、
#. 白い湯けむりの向こうに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>On the other side of the thick, rising steam...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは…見た…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I saw...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どうされました、苗木誠殿！
#. そこにロマンはありませんぞ！
msgctxt "0020 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"What are you doing, Mr. Naegi!? There are no fantasies\n"
"in there!"
msgstr ""

#. 落ち着くのです、素数を数えるのですッ！
msgctxt "0021 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"If you need to calm down, try counting prime\n"
"numbers..."
msgstr ""

#. 敵前逃亡とは情けなしッ！
msgctxt "0022 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"No quarter will be given to those who retreat from the\n"
"enemy!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そ、そうだよな。
#. ここで逃げてちゃ男が立たない！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>H-He's right... If I run away now, I'll never be able\n"
"to stand as a true man!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
